  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Certain post processing settings in Worlds break stream camera! It creates this line in the middle and offsets the image. Only appears when in VR and it's only visible on the Desktop game window (why it only affects the stream camera). \n\nI Stream the game and I have 2 clips of playing on the beta last week with a good example\n\nYou clearly see when the post processing is being toggled off:\n\nhttps://clips.twitch.tv/BoredHandsomePuffinKevinTurtle-jTtQ_KnOrbDuUiOj\n\nhttps://clips.twitch.tv/ShakingBitterLemurFailFish-Oc4SE-V_JOsUuxYN\n\nWorld below is great to test it! Recreate, go to world, in VR, enable Stream camera, look at desktop window, its there!\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4ad8b953-c81d-42e9-b342-c223beae1d77",
